{"title": "Improved Bardic Inspiration: Attack Roll or Ability Check", "pageid": 53394, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Improved_Bardic_Inspiration:_Attack_Roll_or_Ability_Check", "categories": ["Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">See also: <a href=\"/wiki/Improved_Bardic_Inspiration_(disambiguation)\" title=\"Improved Bardic Inspiration (disambiguation)\">Improved Bardic Inspiration (disambiguation)</a>        </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Bardic_Inspiration.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Bardic_Inspiration.webp/300px-Bardic_Inspiration.webp, /w/images/1/13/Bardic_Inspiration.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Bardic_Inspiration.webp/300px-Bardic_Inspiration.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/Bardic_Inspiration.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Improved Bardic Inspiration: Attack Roll or Ability Check</b> is a passive feature that allows the user to improve the success of their next attack or ability roll.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Add a +1d12 bonus to your next <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Roll</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Check\">Ability Check</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Other ways to learn:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Granted to the user if they have <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Improved_Bardic_Inspiration_(Condition)\" title=\"Improved Bardic Inspiration (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d3/Bardic_Inspiration_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Bardic_Inspiration_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d3/Bardic_Inspiration_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Bardic_Inspiration_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d3/Bardic_Inspiration_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Bardic_Inspiration_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Improved Bardic Inspiration\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d3/Bardic_Inspiration_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Bardic_Inspiration_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d3/Bardic_Inspiration_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Improved_Bardic_Inspiration_(Condition)\" title=\"Improved Bardic Inspiration (Condition)\">Improved Bardic Inspiration</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715045639\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.030 seconds\nRea